{"title": "Tampang 3 Pembunuh Polisi di Katingan Meringis Kesakitan Usai Didor Aparat", "description": "A joint team from the Narcotics Crime Directorate (Dittipidnarkoba) of the National Police Criminal Investigation Agency (Bareskrim Polri) arrested three men suspected of being the perpetrators of the attack that killed three members of the Katingan Police Narcotics Unit, Central Kalimantan.<br><br>The three men are Bio, Perie, and Ramblan, also known as Busu. Bio is known to be a drug dealer being pursued by the Katingan Police Narcotics Unit.<br><br>After the arrests, the joint team, led by the Head of Sub-Directorate IV of the Narcotics Directorate of the National Police Criminal Investigation Agency (Bareskrim Polri), Senior Commissioner Handik, and the Narcotics Investigation Center (NIC) Task Force of the National Police Criminal Investigation Agency (Bareskrim Polri), Senior Commissioner Kelly L, then transported the three perpetrators to Jakarta.<br><br>According to Kompas.com&apos;s observation at the Kramatjati Police Hospital in the early hours of Friday (July 10, 2026), the three perpetrators were seen grimacing as they were taken.<br><br>All three received firm, measured action on both legs for resisting arrest.<br><br>Senior Commissioner Kelly stated that the perpetrators resisted arrest with machetes.<br><br>Therefore, the joint team immediately took the three perpetrators to the National Police Hospital for further treatment.<br><br>Scriptwriter: Dzaky Nurcahyo<br>Video Journalist: Dzaky Nurcahyo<br>Video: Dzaky Nurcahyo<br>Producer: Abba Gabrillin<br><br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/news\">#news</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/police\">#police</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/katingan\">#katingan</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/bareskrimpolri\">#bareskrimpolri</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/vjlab\">#vjlab</a><br><br>This article can be viewed at: <a href=\"https://video.kompas.co